msgstr "Leasachadh duilleag pàighidh òrdughan"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-pay.php:60
msgid "Give unpaid orders the same clear, conversion-focused layout as checkout."
msgstr ""
"Thoir an aon chruth soilleir, stèidhichte air tionndadh, do òrdughan gun "
"phàigheadh ri pàigheadh."

