msgid "Optimize the layout of the order pay page for orders pending payment."
msgstr ""
"Dèan cruth na duilleige pàighidh òrduigh nas fheàrr airson òrdughan a tha "
"ri pàigheadh."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-pay.php:63
msgid ""
"Match the order pay experience to your checkout for a consistent purchase "
"journey."
msgstr ""
"Maidseadh an t-eòlas pàighidh òrduigh ris an àite-pàighidh agad airson "
"turas ceannach cunbhalach."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-order-pay.php:64
msgid "Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance before paying."
msgstr ""
"Cuir samhlaidhean agus bràistean earbsa ris far a bheil feum aig "
"luchd-ceannach air dearbhadh mus pàigh iad."

