#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:301
msgid ""
"Requests require a logged-in WordPress user. Omit user_id to use the "
"current user's data, or pass user_id to target another account when the "
"caller can edit that user (edit_user capability). Unauthenticated requests "
"return fc_api_forbidden. An invalid user_id returns fc_api_user_not_found."
msgstr ""
"Feumaidh iarrtasan cleachdaiche WordPress a tha air logadh a-steach. Leig "
"seachad user_id gus dàta an neach-cleachdaidh làithreach a chleachdadh, no "
"thoir seachad user_id gus cunntas eile a thargaideadh nuair as urrainn don "
"neach-gairm an neach-cleachdaidh sin a dheasachadh (comas edit_user). Bidh "
"iarrtasan neo-dhearbhte a’ tilleadh fc_api_forbidden. Bidh user_id "
"neo-dhligheach a’ tilleadh fc_api_user_not_found."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:316
msgid "HTTP 200 with { \"data\": { ... } } when the handler returns a payload."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 200 le { &quot;dàta&quot;: { ... } } nuair a bhios an làimhsichear a’ "
"tilleadh luchd."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:317
msgid ""
"HTTP 200 with { \"success\": true } when there is no payload (for example "
"DELETE)."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 200 le { &quot;success&quot;: true } nuair nach eil luchd ann (mar "
"eisimpleir DELETE)."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:318
msgid ""
"Failures return WordPress REST error JSON from WP_Error (code, message, "
"data.status). Wire codes use the fc_api_* prefix."
msgstr ""
"Bidh fàilligidhean a’ tilleadh mearachd REST WordPress JSON bho WP_Error "
"(còd, teachdaireachd, dàta.status). Bidh còdan uèir a’ cleachdadh an "
"ro-leasachan fc_api_*."

